        { "host": "B", "text": "The caveat matters more than usual here. These are a state-affiliated account's characterisations of Anthropic, not verified findings about what Anthropic does. Anthropic isn't quoted in the post, and only one outlet carries the account of it." }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "transition", "lines": [ { "host": "A", "text": "Now the machines, and the money behind them." } ] },
    {
      "type": "item",
      "section": "Compute, chips & infrastructure",
      "headline": "CXMT says its fifth-generation DRAM platform is in mass production at an 11.95 nm half-pitch",
      "lines": [
