        { "host": "B", "text": "Deepfakes, in plain terms." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Right. And AB 502, from Pellerin and Berman, was chaptered the same day as Chapter 333, with an urgency clause, so it takes effect immediately. It modifies the law barring anyone, with malice, from knowingly distributing a campaign advertisement or election communication containing materially deceptive content." },
